---

## 12. Key Takeaway

This case study explores how a small, contextual improvement to a food-delivery tracking screen could reduce uncertainty for customers.

The central product question is whether explaining confirmed intermediate stops helps customers understand their delivery progress more clearly, without compromising ETA reliability or privacy.

The next step is not to assume the feature works. It is to validate the problem, test the concept, measure the outcome, and use the evidence to decide what to do next.

